{
    "word": "jessica",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "209407de-8889-38dd-b9f1-0a3418f5a7c3",
                "word": "Jessica",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "e9f45b6f-3b31-43eb-814b-36f31f4ae0f6",
                        "entry_id": "209407de-8889-38dd-b9f1-0a3418f5a7c3",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "Jessicas"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7a76685e-cac4-3804-b292-b9d78f6ff809",
                        "entry_id": "209407de-8889-38dd-b9f1-0a3418f5a7c3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A female given name from Hebrew."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9018acdf-d8d8-4bd5-aefc-b7fdd5507abc",
                                "sense_id": "7a76685e-cac4-3804-b292-b9d78f6ff809",
                                "text": "Lorenzo: In such a night / Did Jessica steal from the wealthy Jew, / And with an unthrift love did run from Venice, / As far as Belmont."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b5a0c56-016a-4758-9982-6dd78a8d2898",
                                "sense_id": "7a76685e-cac4-3804-b292-b9d78f6ff809",
                                "text": "She will be beautiful, of course - how could our child not be beautiful? We will name her...Jessica. Yes, that's a good name, not one of those lighter-than-air names so popular among writers of romances and fairy tales. That's a name a real little girl might have."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eda89fb1-5977-4d37-842a-ea48f76b86ff",
                                "sense_id": "7a76685e-cac4-3804-b292-b9d78f6ff809",
                                "text": "Jessica. It was, she later thought, a name well suited to whitehaired ladies with bright blue eyes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ba76df33-de4d-4c08-bfed-16743b8e324c",
                                "sense_id": "7a76685e-cac4-3804-b292-b9d78f6ff809",
                                "text": "The first line of dialogue is from an off-screen Field Commander Melissa Lewis (Jessica Chastain), asking the team to stay in sight and “make NASA proud”."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b7a7155a-d1e7-46e4-8fc8-1ea27ae6b94a",
                        "source_entry_id": "209407de-8889-38dd-b9f1-0a3418f5a7c3",
                        "source_sense_id": "7a76685e-cac4-3804-b292-b9d78f6ff809",
                        "source_sense_description": "a female given name",
                        "target_lang_word": "Jessica",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Jessica",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "99131861-b727-3a56-a910-e4a7506ba28a",
                                        "entry_id": "cb8d6847-816d-3d59-ab77-91a9e5d83d9e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Prénom féminin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f43cba32-6885-48cb-9eb3-5cc9a4ed2aca",
                                                "sense_id": "99131861-b727-3a56-a910-e4a7506ba28a",
                                                "text": "Jessica Chastain, dans un rôle surprenant, et une séquence de cambriolage au suspense haletant prouvent que le cinéaste a gardé tout son talent pour surprendre et charmer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61cb8c9f-7509-485c-9be9-d85ac40e0711",
                                                "sense_id": "99131861-b727-3a56-a910-e4a7506ba28a",
                                                "text": "Dans le tableau féminin, la Rennaise Camille Prigent, 8ᵉ mondiale, devra élever son niveau pour rivaliser avec l’Australienne Jessica Fox et l’Allemande Ricarda Funk."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76570b92-b2d0-4ab3-a265-b66842ea2b27",
                                                "sense_id": "99131861-b727-3a56-a910-e4a7506ba28a",
                                                "text": "Pourquoi la disparition de Jessica Nenan réapparaît aujourd’hui sur les réseaux sociaux ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
